================ DECISIONS (pre-registered) ================
D1 label value = +0.006: SATURATED -> full-vocab Acc@1 cannot show a big pretraining gain; centre the paper on zero/few-shot, cold start and new places
D2 pretraining gain at cold start = -0.002 (CI -0.003,-0.001): NO detectable transferable knowledge in the backbone
D3 scaling 1->6 cities: with evidence 0.0116, backbone-only 0.0287: RISING -> build the STD-scale corpus (~30M check-ins) and pretrain on it
D4 best backbone-only minus v6 HREM = -0.047: backbone is NOT the carrier -> present GEMMA as a structured return-explore model with a pretrained encoder, not as a backbone-first foundation model
    generative (GEMMA-G) vs supervised, backbone only: -0.007 -> no evidence that the objective matters at this data scale
